# What breaks is only the claim that a named target is the ONLY target -- which is the property
# the operator relies on when they publish a trial to one workspace and not to their live work.
#
# THE PAIRED REDS (plan 5.3):
#
#   unnamed_workspace_is_untouched: FAIL ... swapping beta ...
#   asleep_workspace_is_untouched:  FAIL ... swapping asleep ...
